<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59485" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κουρο-τρόφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rearing children</i>, rare
			in lit. sense, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνὴ νεοτόκος καὶ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CA</u>
					2.3
				</span></i>
			: usu. metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαθὴ κ.</span>
			good <i>nursing-mother</i>, of Ithaca, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.27
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				109
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. Ἑλλάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					566
				</span></i>
			 (lyr., s.v.l.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀπόλλωνος
			κ.</span>, of Delos, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Del.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				276
			</span></i>: freq. as epith. of goddesses, as Hecate, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				450
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρτεμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					5.73
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λοχία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
					3.400.9
				</span></i>
			 (Delph., <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>); of the Roman goddess
			Rumina, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.278d
			</span></i>; esp. of Aphrodite, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
				<u>Epigr.</u>
				12
			</span></i>; called ἡ K. alone, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.840.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				299
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i> Com.<i><span class="en">
				174.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMeretr.</u>
				5.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ πύλαι αἱ κατὰ
			Κουροτρόφον</span>, at Delos, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).203
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				46
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>:—in form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κουροτρόπος</span></b> , ὁ
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>), name of Acarnanian
			month, ib.<i><span class="en">
				5(1).29.11
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Sparta</span>).</div>
